Package: space.kern0x1b.rev-safari
Name: Revenant WebKit Safari
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: The loader of the Revenant WebKit engine under Mobile Safari, with the engine.
 The loader re-execs Safari with the engine's DYLD_* set, so Safari renders
 today's web: modern CSS and layout, Web Crypto, WebAssembly, inline video and
 audio. The compat dylib, TLS and the Settings pane come from space.kern0x1b.rev,
 which this package depends on.
Depends: space.kern0x1b.rev (= 0.1.0), mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
Section: Tweaks
Priority: optional
Author: kern0x1b
Maintainer: kern0x1b
